[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the switch unit.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections (2a,2b) and set aside the\nswitch unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Front sun roof switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890410\">H61</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Rear sun roof switch from front seats</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890412\">H62</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035659.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. If necessary, remove the switches from the embellishment and\nset them aside.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035660.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the switches are\nnot damaged.</p><p>If necessary, conduct an electrical test\non the switches.</p><p>If removed, fit the switches in the trim.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nswitches.</p><p>Fit the switch unit in its seating.</p><p>Check that the switches are working.</p>"]]